  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n・{失恋|しつれん}する (to have one's heart broken)\n・{失恋|しつれん}の{痛|いた}み (the pain of heartbreak)\n・{失恋|しつれん}から{立|た}ち{直|なお}る (to recover from heartbreak)\n・{失恋|しつれん}ソング (heartbreak song)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{振|ふ}られる - to be dumped, rejected (more casual)\n・{別|わか}れる - to break up (neutral)\n\n{失恋|しつれん} emphasizes the emotional pain of romantic rejection or ended love.\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
